    "State-machine tests force fades on each backend; only the Forward+ rendered transition uses the production fade gate.",
    "The native Mobile renderer and physical Android/web performance are unvalidated; their defaults are not changed.",
    "Native opacity does not cache shadow maps or establish frame-time/VRAM savings. The cap counts shadow-enabled local lights, not retained native atlas allocations.",
